    "body": "![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1383193/69914538-440e1680-144e-11ea-93d1-5d9b1f28c915.png)\r\nI did some further testing. It seems that this isn't related to the fact that starship runs from the powershell prompt function, because even running it directory from Powershell makes it think that it's referring to the initial Powershell path. It seem that also `/bin/pwd` is able to see the change in the working directory. Does starship determine the working directory in some special way?",
